{"id":"wb-6-384","name":"汾城古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汾城古建筑群","text":"汾城古建筑群位于中国山西省襄汾县汾城镇城内村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。汾城镇原为太平县治所，现存四十余座古建筑，由北向南分布有城隍庙、文庙、鼓楼、学前砖塔、县衙大堂、关帝庙、社稷庙、洪济桥、城墙等，时代从金至清末。古建筑群布局完整，至今保留了古代县城所有的功能性建筑，包括县衙，以及祭祀用的城隍庙、社稷庙、关帝庙等，对研究金以来县级城市的建筑、城市规划、政治经济等有重要价值。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%BE%E5%9F%8E%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":87846089,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87846089","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6b2bee8d0108292d8f5687ee.jpg","title":"Fenchenggujianzhuqun.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fenchenggujianzhuqun.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Fenchenggujianzhuqun.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"TIY","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汾城古建筑群","width":320,"height":427}}